        # Re-Building XMind Files Section (RXF)
        # ============================================================
        # Applies Strip Properties / Level Design / Color Capacity (and
        # optionally appends new sheets) to a one-off rebuild -- lets you
        # quickly export/preview a styling variant without changing any of
        # your live settings in the Levels Design / Strip Properties
        # sections themselves. F-Nodes and IFM images are no longer
        # triggerable from here -- add those from the F-Node Section's and
